cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ProdPilot or its dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "ProdPilot"
abstract: >-
  A local Model Context Protocol server that audits Node.js and React
  projects against 50 production readiness rules, repairs violations through
  a bounded loop with independent verification, gates the result with a
  deployability model trained on real deployment outcomes, and deploys it.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/prodpilotai/ProdPilot"
keywords:
  - production readiness
  - automated program repair
  - Model Context Protocol
  - deployability prediction
  - DevOps
  - static analysis
